WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.705 --> 00:00:02.063
(upbeat piano music)

00:00:02.063 --> 00:00:04.696
- [Voiceover] In the old
English seaside town of Margate,

00:00:04.696 --> 00:00:07.011
there is a mysterious underground cavern,

00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:09.928
adorned with millions of seashells.

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:13.613
Its winding passages
stretch more than 70 feet

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.300
and are believed to have been constructed

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.967
in the early 1800s.

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:21.482
But no one knows who built them, or why.

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:32.792
(electronic downbeat music)

